 MCUs foliage can really make a world  of difference I was to be honest really  skeptical about this station building  for pretty much the entire recording  until I started adding all of this  foliage around it I think with all of  the bushes and everything it works out  decently and it doesn't really stick out  anymore  not to mention then it kind of actually  fits the theme of the rollercoaster I  sort of just yolo'd this whole theme I  didn't really expect much out of an  intimate mega lights themed to Islamic  architecture because truth be told I  really just wanted to try the supports  and try the Islamic architecture  elements that we got in the new updates  but actually work pretty well together  I also a trick li slightly changed the  color of the track and live in the  middle of this episode to a slightly  more pink issue at which point I think  it is now definitely pink and not any  more rights in the middle between pink  and red so yeah I think that's a little  bit more needs I think the red coaster  track is kind of an overused color  scheme and we need more pink coasters in  this world in any case I'm just trying  to finish this up with all of these  flower beds  there's not really a sound of a logic to  the flowers that I chose or to the  colors that I chose it probably could  have been a little bit more well thought  out but I think it works well enough for  the test that it is and for me it's  definitely proven that these flowers are  gonna stand the test of time and that  they actually mix in quite well with the  phone  that we have in the game so far so yeah  I'm quite happy with them only thing  that I really couldn't use them for is  for some of this remaining foliage  underneath the coaster where there's  just sort of a ruined grass texture and  some sand and mud and then some little  bits of grass and small shrubs here and  there which is just a sort of ground  texture that I want to try and use  because it's more interesting to look at  than a completely empty ground but it's  really just kind of a mess it's not  really planted or anything like that  it's just trying to look like the end  result of not caring for your ground and  just letting all the wheat grow for a  few years in any case that's it for this  episode so I want to thank you guys for  watching and I'll see you next time  [Music]  [Music]
 

